Manufactured homes shall be prohibited in V-Zones. Within A-Zones, all new, replaced or substantially improved
manufactured homes shall be:
1. Installed using methods and practices that minimize flood damage;
2. Elevated to or above the design flood elevation specified in ASCE 24, Table 2-1;
3. Placed on a permanent, reinforced foundation that is designed in accordance with ASCE 24; and
4. Securely anchored to a foundation system designed to resist flotation, collapse and lateral movement. Metho
